    "snowbird": {
      "status": "ok",
      "resort": "Snowbird",
      "adapter": "powdr",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-30 05:35:13",
      "note": "Gooooood morning Snowbird! It’s Owen, with your snow report for Monday. Mountain Update: 8 am - 2 pm spring lift operations will remain in place through Monday, March 30. Hours of operation will be reassessed later in the week. It’s looking like we’re going to have to wait just a bit longer for snow, potentially through tonight. This afternoon’s 30% chance of snow unfortunately turned into not that, but up until then, we’ve got mostly sunny skies with a high of 58° until around 3 pm, which is when things might get a bit damp. Let’s all hope for some slightly colder temperatures overnight. If we all stick our fans outside and have our A/Cs blowing outwards tonight, that will certainly help. Until then, take advantage of the spring skiing conditions, it's Surf Season. If you haven't yet gotten your Chickadee Fever badge on the Snowbird App, now is the time! The Chickadee Lift will close for the 2025-26 season for replacement on April 6th. The new Chickadee Lift is expected to reopen for summer operations in July. ALL uphill travel is closed. Don’t be that guy (or gal). Please remember to ski and ride in control, if you don’t, you’re gonna have a bad time. It's Surf Season, so to quote that one guy, \"drop in, just smack the lip, wapow.\" Go get pitted y’all. #GMTB",
